# Normalize Go sources to LF on every platform.
#
# gofmt -l only accepts LF input. Windows checkouts (CI runners or local
# clones with core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise convert the index's LF to
# CRLF and make every Go file appear unformatted. `text eol=lf` overrides
# autocrlf for these files while leaving other text files untouched.
*.go text eol=lf
